      "comment": "Processes an input buffer and encodes it with context flags.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Initialize global buffer counter to 0\n2. Initialize local encoding configuration with bufferSize=0 and encodingMode=6\n3. Store context flags to global state and local variable\n4. Process input buffer through FUN_6fa26ec0, generating processed data\n5. Encode the processed buffer with context through EncodeBufferWithContext\n6. Return to caller\n\nParameters:\n  pBuffer: Input buffer pointer (char*) - data to be processed and encoded\n  nContextFlags: Context control flags (ushort) - controls encoding behavior and state\n\nReturns:\n  void - function returns no value\n\nSpecial Cases:\n  - bufferSize is incremented by 3 before encoding to account for header/footer\n  - encodingMode is initialized to 6, possibly indicating encryption variant\n  - Global state DAT_6fa2b1c8 tracks active operations\n  - Global state DAT_6fa2aeb4 stores context flags for other modules",
